      "rationale": "The finalized blueprint assigns this paper claim to Model/Theorem.",
      "owner": "Model/Theorem",
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "obligation:9ef526af-5a96-4ec2-8b05-470f3cb71fc2",
      "kind": "headline",
      "summary": "Space in bits: thresh·⌈log₂ n⌉ = O((1/ε²) log n (log m + log 1/δ))",
