      "summary": "Coupling: Algorithm 2's (p_j, X_j) equals (2^{-k}, Y_{k,j}) when p_j = 2^{-k} (in law, jointly over j)",
      "rationale": "The finalized blueprint assigns this paper claim to Analysis.",
